# Emitted Messages

```block
Provides development information about a file. By default, it prints the CST of the file.

Usage: inspect file [--ast] [--ir] [--semantic] PATH

Available positional items:
    PATH            Path to the file

Available options:
        --ast       Prints the AST of the file.
        --ir        Prints the formatter IR, if supported.
        --semantic  Prints the semantic information of a file, if it exists.
    -h, --help      Prints help information

```
